# RankPulse is a static, client-side application and does not require a server key.
#
# AI briefs use the Gemini API directly from the visitor's browser. For safety,
# visitors paste their own Gemini API key in the RankPulse AI panel; it is held
# in memory for the request and is never written to localStorage.
#
# Do NOT add a shared Gemini API key as VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY. VITE_* variables
# are embedded in the public JavaScript bundle on build and are not secret.
